<title>SWITZERLAND: SMH says has higher hopes for sales.</title>
<headline>SMH says has higher hopes for sales.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss watchmaker Ste Suisse Microelectronique et d'Horlogerie SA (SMH) said accelerating sales in June and July gave it higher hopes for sales in August and the rest of 1997.</p>
<p>SMH, whose brands range from plastic Swatch watches to luxury Blancpain timepieces, declined to make a forecast for the full year because of the importance of Christmas sales and currency exchange rates.</p>
</text>
